From: Realme X2 Pro Linux port <hmhmdcy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] gadget: support board descriptor overrides

Allow board configuration to override the USB descriptor fields that were
previously hard-coded per mode. Keep the shipped defaults unchanged when no
override is present.

Also wait for real host enumeration before starting userspace services, and
accept initramfs-owned gadgets that do not have an explicit configuration
string.
---
